---
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="about-text">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">About Us</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Local Expertise,<br />Serious Equipment</h2>
      <br />
      <p class="about-body">Desilets Landworks LLC is a locally owned and operated land management company based in Bellingham, Massachusetts. We bring professional-grade equipment and a hands-on work ethic to every project, big or small.</p>
      <p class="about-body">Whether you're a homeowner clearing a lot, a contractor prepping a build site, or a business that needs dependable snow removal all season long — we show up ready to work.</p>
      <div class="location-badge">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13S3 17 3 10a9 9 0 0118 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
        </svg>
        Based in Bellingham, MA
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-visual">
      <div class="about-img-frame">
        <div class="about-placeholder">
          <img src="/Skid_Truck_Trailer_Snow.jpg" alt="Truck with a skid steer loaded on the trailer">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="amber-accent-box"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--cream-2);
    padding: 96px 48px;
  }
  .about-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .about-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.82;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .about-body:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 28px; }

  .location-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 11px 20px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .location-badge svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--amber); }

  .about-visual { position: relative; }
  .about-img-frame {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    background: var(--navy-mid);
    border-radius: 2px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .about-img-frame::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      -45deg,
      transparent, transparent 14px,
      rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 14px, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 15px
    );
  }
  .about-placeholder {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .about-placeholder p {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }
  .amber-accent-box {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -16px; right: -16px;
    width: 100px; height: 100px;
    background: var(--amber);
    z-index: -1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about { padding: 72px 24px; }
    .about-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .amber-accent-box { display: none; }
  }
</style>
